            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.10.51

- Prevented brief YouTube Music queue synchronization races from displaying the wrong swipe-preview artwork.
- Kept featured-artist title variants, such as a shortened MediaSession title, matched to the correct queue item.
- Added queue-coherence details to the extension diagnostic report.
]]></description>
