            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.10.50

- Replaced the unreliable extension-to-localhost request with Chrome Native Messaging.
- Added a signed native bridge helper bundled with Now and automatic per-user Chrome host registration.
- Added a fixed extension identity and narrowly scoped native-host origin validation.
- Bundled Chrome extension 1.4.0 and verified the complete framed-message path into the running app.
]]></description>
