            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.10.49

- Fixed service-worker sender validation for Chrome content-script messages.
- Validates the extension sender and the payload’s exact YouTube Music origin without relying on an optional sender URL field.
- Bundled Chrome extension 1.3.1 with verified diagnostic forwarding.
]]></description>
